WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Import the reviewed desired state
Illustrative snapshot and one AIO broker; this recording does not test two clusters.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Compare against the destination
Active connection is the target here. Confirm identity before selecting changes.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Select only the intended setting
This owned topic changes retention.ms. Other configuration remains outside the selection.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Review the promotion
Review is read-only. It does not change the target setting.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Confirm and apply once
Recheck the target identity and consequences of reducing retention before applying.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Check acknowledgement and read-back
Success means this selected setting was verified, not that all environments match.
